CapNoeh Launcher — install and run CapCut on Linux under Wine.

Hand it the CapCut installer; it verifies the file, sets everything up,
and then becomes your launcher. Nothing proprietary ships with this
program — you supply the installer yourself.

https://github.com/Noehnoe/CapNoeh
